Third-party content and Pokémon notice

The MIT licence above applies to the source code and documentation written by
the contributors. It does NOT apply to the items below.

Pokémon intellectual property
  Pokémon, Pokémon character names, artwork, card designs and Pokédex text are
  © Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. and The Pokémon Company. This is
  a non-commercial educational project (COMPX374, University of Waikato). It is
  not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by those companies.

  - Official card images and artwork are NOT stored in this repository. They
    are downloaded at setup or runtime from publicly available sources
    (TCGdex, the PokeAPI sprites repository).
  - backend/data/cards/hashes.json holds only perceptual hashes (numbers) derived from
    those images, not the images themselves.
  - assets/card-photos/, assets/figurine-videos/ and backend/data/figurines/exemplars/ hold the team's own
    photographs and videos of physical cards and 3D-printed figurines,
    included solely as test and reference data for non-commercial educational
    use. They depict Pokémon IP and are not licensed under MIT.
  - backend/data/dex.json contains Pokédex entry text retrieved from PokeAPI
    (https://pokeapi.co); the text itself remains © its owners above.

Seeded database
  The Pokémon data seeded into MongoDB (pokemon_utf8.csv inside
  backend/scripts/pokedb-setup.zip) comes from an open source / public domain dataset:
